      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing KMS Encryption**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud KMS for the external key provider. My next task is to implement the encryption logic within `encrypt_payload.py` using the KMS API. I'm focusing on crafting the correct API calls to manage the key and encrypt the payload securely.\n\n\n**Defining Encryption Logic**\n\nNow I have a clearer plan. I've settled on Google Cloud KMS and the libraries I'll need, specifically `google.cloud.kms_v1`. I've outlined the `encrypt_payload` function with the necessary arguments: project, location, keyring, key ID, and the payload. I am planning on instantiating the KMS client and making the API call to encrypt the data. I'm focusing on the steps to construct the key path for KMS. I will move forward to writing the file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865538228,
          "start": 1789865536065
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4caa41001kioGRSWNwI3cZK",
